ind":"announcement","title":"Neural Repair Official Release date","summary":"NOTICE TO ALL EMPLOYEES Your permanent assignment has been scheduled. Neural Repair launches on Steam on January 19, 2027. Until then, the Nexus remains compromised, the Hunters remain unsupervised, and the demo remains free. If you have already played it, thank you. If you haven't, your shift can begin whenever you are ready. BEFORE YOUR START DATE Wishlist Neural Repair. Steam will notify you when your assignment begins.Play the free demo. Tell us what felt great and what felt unfair. Tell a f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:01:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027938","verified_at":"2026-10-21T13:04:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707130-1846651706694097","game_id":"steam-4707130","kind":"update","title":"Splash Screen Patch","summary":"PATCH NOTICEEmployee feedback has been reviewed. Several employees described onboarding as \"a lot.\" Management disagrees, but has made the following adjustments. Splash screens can now be skipped. Press any key. The demo welcome screen has been rewritten. It is shorter and now mentions the Hunters. Thank you for your service, and thank you for the feedback. If something in the demo felt confusing or unfair, tell us in the discussions or on Discord. A solo developer reads all of it.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:45:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707130-1846018067937524","game_id":"steam-4707130","kind":"update","title":"Neural Repair Demo Update","summary":"NEURAL REPAIR — DEMO UPDATENewHunters. From level 5, a corrupted program stalks the grid. It starts slow and lazy, then hops faster and tracks you more closely as you go deeper. A red reticle warns you before every hop. If it lands on you, or you walk into it, you lose stability. Later levels bring a second Hunter. The Hunter always turns to face you.ImprovedFog of war is more see-through, and special tiles now faintly show through it.Your ghost is now translucent, so you can see the tile beneat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T00:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937524","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707130-1845383656392280","game_id":"steam-4707130","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.4.0","summary":"Neural Repair Demo: Next Fest UpdateNewFog of war has a new look. Undiscovered tiles are now covered in drifting smoke instead of flat placeholder squares. Striking a tile burns the fog away, and all remaining fog clears once you're about 75% of the way through the level's timer.Reduce Flashing option. Options and the Pause menu now have a REDUCE FLASHING toggle, off by default. When it's on, the stability-zero cascade and trap short-circuit effects play as a single slow fade with no repeated fl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T00:03:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392280","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707130-1845383656379975","game_id":"steam-4707130","kind":"announcement","title":"Achievements are Here!!","summary":"I have added 15 achievements to the demo!! Most are fairly easy to get but a couple can be tricky!!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T06:07:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379975","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707130-1844751498223949","game_id":"steam-4707130","kind":"update","title":"Neural Repair Demo Patch #1","summary":"**Patch Notes**-Fixed the Dev Notice screen when first loading the game. Can now press space or A (on controller) to instantly print the Notice. Press a second time after its on screen to move to main menu.-Fixed the camera on some of the later, bigger levels. The bottom of the grid was going slightly off screen and also clashing with all UI elements on the bottom of the screen.-Fixed the \"Controls Scrambled\" UI element remaining on screen upon failure. It was causing issue reading the failure t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T09:29:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223949","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707130-1843481262696599","game_id":"steam-4707130","kind":"announcement","title":"Neural Repair Demo Release!","summary":"The Demo will be dropping on September 18th! Keep in mind this is just the base game loop and there is so much more work to do on the game. It's really fun, especially once you start figuring it out! The demo is capped at 20 levels but because of the procedural generation, even on the demo version, each run will be different. Both Restoration and Nightmare Modes are included! The discord for Lone Bad Wolf Studios is on the store page, So if you encounter ANY problems, PLEASE reach out to me and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T22:30:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696599","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707130-1833334318578573","game_id":"steam-4707130","kind":"announcement","title":"First Dev Log Video","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T05:35:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318578573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4707130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4707130":"2026-10-26T03:40:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4707130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5133420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4707130","app_id":4707130,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"cb72dc7138d964982b62485bef7fa2dbd54c35b0866add74b3a2bd67f083b00b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"ATTENTION OPERATOR: Congrats on volunteering to repair a dying AI! (You didn't volunteer.) Light every tile. Do not retrace your steps. In this puzzle roguelike, avoid traps, fog, and that red thing. Should your stability hit zero, all progress will be wiped. NEXUS thanks you for your sacrifice!","publishers":[{"name":"Lone Bad Wolf Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"Lone Bad Wolf Studios"}]},"release":{"steam_releas